WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.930
Are you working?

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.560
Yeah.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.320
Wanna try it?

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:12.780
Yes.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.550
In some ways, Rurumo is a genius...

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.930
Yeah...

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:30.910
It's not coming out.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.590
A portal to the spirit world just opened nearby.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:18.530
Rank 1 Witch Haruriri Descends

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:18.990
I wish something good would happen.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.040
Like a girl suddenly falling out of the sky...

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:35.630
<i>That's a...</i>

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.560
<b>Panty</b>

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.560
<i>Panty shot acquired!</i>

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.560
<b>Shot</b>

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.220
Hey.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.240
Ow!

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.220
Hello.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:55.690
I am the rank 1 witch Warura Haruriri.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.400
This is my familiar, Mimi.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.950
<i>Actually, she does kinda look like a witch...</i>

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:05.660
<i>I-I was distracted by her panties 
and didn't notice!</i>

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:10.830
I have descended to form a contract 
with you, Shibaki Kota-kun.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.560
A contract?

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.920
The kind that means you'll grant me any wish?

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:15.750
Yes.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.510
And the price is, of course...

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.470
<b>I'll help 
myself!</b>

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.560
I'll help myself!

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:20.470
<i>...my life!</i>

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:22.340
Here are your tickets.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.090
I don't want them!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.600
Goodbye forever!

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.350
<i>That was close.</i>

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:31.140
<i>I almost had my lifespan shortened again...</i>

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.560
<i>Why must I be so needlessly 
good at finding witches?!</i>

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.730
Simply agree to the contract.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.660
Do that and... Radai!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.790
You can use magic like this for free.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:43.900
Yeah, so you say...

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:44.410
Oh, my.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:48.240
But a contract would cost me 
my life, wouldn't it?!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.500
Damel.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.220
I'm not falling for that!

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.680
There's no need for that.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.840
These are cost exemption tickets.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:00.050
"Cost exemption"?

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.250
Yes.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:05.040
Normally, using magic would cost you your life,

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.900
but these don't require that.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.850
They're premium tickets that 
allow you to use magic freely.

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:11.930
Premium...

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:16.400
Why don't you use one ticket as a trial run

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.860
before agreeing to a contract?

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.860
Let's just give up.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.610
It's all right.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.120
Here we go.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.830
Oh, boy...

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.510
Someone's using magic nearby.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:33.720
Magic?

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:34.960
Is it a witch?

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:38.210
I know this style of magic...

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.380
It's Haruriri.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.100
Haruriri?

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.340
You mean <i>that</i> Haruriri?

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.010
<i>This is for you.</i>

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.690
<b>Closing Ceremony Today
Go to the Gymnasium</b>

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.690
You're telling the truth, right?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.570
It really won't cost me my life, right?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.870
A witch never goes back on her word.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.580
In that case...

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.040
I have one wish!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.120
See you later!

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:24.480
Rurumo formed a contract with 
quite a strange individual.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.700
Haruriri!

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:29.130
Oh, my. It's been a while, Chiro.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:32.140
Did ya come to harass Rurumo again?

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.270
What are you talking about?

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.280
Don't play dumb!

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.690
You just wanna make trouble for Rurumo!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.400
You're a sharp one.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:44.650
D-Don't tell me ya formed a contract with him?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.990
With a dual contract—

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.040
Yes.

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:49.530
The newer contract is given priority.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.920
The previous contract is dissolved.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.790
All her training until now is rendered invalid,

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.660
meaning Rurumo will never become a witch.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.890
Do ya really hate Rurumo that much?

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:09.680
I'm about to have some real fun here.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.430
Don't get in my way.

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:20.650
I'm going to check out this Earth school.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.980
Good morning.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.830
Summer vacation finally begins tomorrow.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:32.950
Recently, our bicycle racing club 
advanced to the Inter-high.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:37.120
Additionally, the film club's 
student film contest entry was...

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:34.960
<i>Shoulder straps!</i>

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.120
<i>I've finally acquired the eyes of a god!</i>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.730
<i>Haruriri-chan, thank you for this blessing!</i>

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.890
<i>The boys in front of me are in the way.</i>

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:47.090
<i>Fine, then...</i>

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.680
<i>In order to get my fill of girls...</i>

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.090
I'll stand in front!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.050
Huh?

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.800
It's Shibaki the pervert!

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:56.520
Gross!

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.120
They're back to normal...

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:00.980
You pervert!

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.900
It's been a while, Haruriri.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.690
Oh, Rurumo-chan!

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.370
Your old-fashioned hat and cape...

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.330
are so lame.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.100
I said you look lame!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.140
I see.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.540
As always, you show no reaction at all...

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:26.630
That's exactly what I

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.590
hate about you.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.340
I see.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.220
It's terrible, Haruriri-chan!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.940
My god-like eyes...

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.500
My dream eyes are back to normal!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.290
Rurumo. You know her?

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.180
From magic school.

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:46.860
You seem quite composed.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.120
Listen to me.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.120
I came to form a contract with him.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:55.090
Once he names himself as my 
contractor, it's over for you.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.030
It'll be a formal contract.

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.200
So? How do you feel?

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.360
Are you sad?

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:05.320
Cry! Scream!

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:06.960
Destroy your stony mask,

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.960
and show me how you really feel!

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:14.050
It can't be helped.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:17.510
It's for him to decide.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.020
Are you stupid?

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:25.080
You're always like this.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.980
You didn't even react when 
you were thrown into prison.

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:31.400
Aren't you frustrated? Doesn't it hurt?

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.110
Everyone makes fun of you!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.530
I know.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.410
But they're right.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.660
I take longer than everyone else,
so all I can do is do my best.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.280
That's not what I'm asking!

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.030
I'm asking why you never react to anything!

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:53.970
Since the day I met you,
you've always been that way.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:09:01.320
When I first transferred to magic school,
I was often bullied.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:03.740
And you...

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:06.020
<i>Do you want to use this?</i>

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.480
I was happy.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:17.160
So I wanted to do my best to return the favor.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.750
But you...

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>Well? Do you want this cape?</i>

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.520
<i>It's scary.</i>

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.410
<i>Well? Do you want this hair accessory?</i>

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:28.570
<i>Not really.</i>

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:30.200
<i>How was this book?</i>

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.310
<i>I liked it.</i>

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.300
<i>Really? What'd you like about it?</i>

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:38.910
<i>Show more of a reaction!</i>

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.270
<i>Don't you have anything else to say?</i>

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:42.450
<i>No.</i>

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:45.730
No matter how much I push,
 you don't respond.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.520
Even now, you're acting cool, 
despite the danger you're in!

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.980
Why won't you talk to me?

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.700
I waited for you.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:10:01.160
When you were thrown in prison 
and demoted to a trainee witch,

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.660
I waited for you to come talk to me!

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.670
Don't you have anything to say to me?!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.340
I came all the way to Earth just to see you!

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.640
An old friend

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.830
came to see me today.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.390
Today is a good day.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.240
Come, Haruriri.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.900
I'll take you to the cafeteria.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.640
I know what you mean.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.450
I can't read her expressions,

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.870
and she's the type to try to 
handle everything herself.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.550
But she's telling the truth.

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:50.580
She's not clever enough to lie.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:52.620
Let's go.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.410
Don't be so impertinent.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.650
You're just a contractor.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.760
I finally got it off...

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.510
Hey, Haruriri!

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:11.160
What are ya gonna do if he actually picks you?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.650
That was never possible to begin with.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:17.820
<b>Seal</b>

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.820
The contract had a magical seal placed on it.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.030
Huh? Then ya just came here to see Rurumo?

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:23.640
I did not!

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.370
Yer not very honest, are ya?

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:31.390
There's no one here today, so I made this.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.710
It's on me. Drink, Haruriri.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.630
<i>She carried it over without spilling it.</i>

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:40.590
Actually, something's been 
bothering me for a while now...

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:42.970
Don't you mean Haruriri-sama?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.730
I'm a higher rank than you.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.070
It's so bitter!

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.770
It's called coffee.

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.030
Everyone likes to drink it.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.790
It tastes weird.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:57.450
And it's bitter!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.570
She seems a little happy.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:03.410
Bring me something sweet next.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.010
Yeah, she does.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:10.000
I told 
you...

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:10.000
...to 
come 
talk 
to me!!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:10.000
What?

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.920
I'm thirsty.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.890
Yes, right away.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.940
What are ya doin' here, anyway?

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:21.580
I didn't tell you?

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.180
I got some time off.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.970
It's summer vacation on Earth now, right?

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:27.200
The timing's perfect.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:29.970
Have some Talpis.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.270
Thank you.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:32.280
Certainly.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:34.730
Ya don't need to be nice to her!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.360
Now, now.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.210
She came all the way from the 
spirit world to see Rurumo,

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:41.930
and it's good to have more cute girls around!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.160
I'm going out.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.130
Hang on a sec.

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:50.480
Oh, thanks for being so considerate.

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:53.040
I'd like some really delicious ice cream.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:57.630
Here. It's hot, so take some water with you.

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:58.990
Thank you.

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:03.090
But knowing you, I'm sure 
you'd pick something weird...

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.090
Guess it can't be helped. I'll just go with you.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:08.550
Thank you.

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.220
So, where are we going?

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:13.020
A bakery? A department store 
basement? A sweets shop?

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.920
I did my research!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.440
<i>Just go already...</i>

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:18.630
Welcome!

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:19.820
Welcome.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.330
Hello!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:22.290
Hello.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.800
Welcome to Rammy's!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:24.970
Welcome.

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:29.720
Wait! This is work!

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:31.910
That was pretty good.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.760
Pretty good...

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:34.970
Don't give me that!

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.620
When you said you were going out,
 you meant to work?!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:38.290
I can't help it.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.880
The cafeteria is closed for summer vacation.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.490
So take the time off!

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:45.830
Your old friend is visiting you!
This isn't the time to work!

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:46.880
Excuse me!

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.220
I'd like to order!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.260
Got it.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.220
This conversation isn't over!

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:54.980
It really is Ruru-san!

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.900
We heard you were working here 
over summer vacation.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:58.930
Yes.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:01.260
Those who do not work are turned into stone.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.390
Stone?

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:03.280
What is your order?

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:04.660
Um...

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:08.740
Could you call me "Brother" again?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.370
I never said that. What is your order?

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.120
I will repeat your order.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.500
That's one "hamburg" set and one "patas" set.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.260
Um... it's not patas, it's pasta—

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:24.050
And two types of drink bars.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:25.360
Got it.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.550
That doesn't seem right.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:32.510
<b>Whaaat?!</b>

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:32.510
Hamburg
Patas
Drink bar 2
"Set," apparently

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.400
<i>She's writing it by hand?</i>

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:32.100
<i>And she's using that thing as a writing surface?!</i>

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.930
<b>They Ended Up Fired</b>

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:38.120
Of course.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.710
Was it a little too difficult?

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:40.520
What?

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.580
Don't worry about it.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.720
It requires training.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.980
Why are <i>you</i> trying to cheer <i>me</i> up?

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:51.240
Kota told me everyone has their 
strengths and weaknesses.

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:53.630
<i>What? Kota...</i>

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:55.700
<i>Why is she bringing him up now?</i>

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:58.780
Don't worry.

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.720
I have another job lined up.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.420
There's another one?!

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:05.970
Welcome.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.510
Espressos coming up.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.810
<i>Are we seriously doing this?</i>

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:10.970
Trainee!

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:15.440
For starters, take this hot pizza to table 5.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:16.490
Got it.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:18.930
Hey, wait!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.400
<b>Instantly Fired</b>

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:29.040
It's not your fault.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.380
I know that!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:34.360
Many jobs on Earth are complex and difficult.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:42.290
Yeah, they might be a little difficult for you.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.360
For me?

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:47.630
<i>Yes, for you! Don't you have 
any self-awareness, you dolt?</i>

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:53.010
Kota said it's important to first 
become accustomed to your work.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:55.400
<i>Kota again...</i>

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:57.370
Well, then...

00:15:58.110 --> 00:15:59.280
Let's go to the next job.

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.770
Where do you get that endless drive to work?!

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.270
<b>Ice Candy</b>

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:06.730
This should be okay.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.490
<i>What...?</i>

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:23.250
You really aren't cut out for working.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.820
<i>You're not cut out to 
be anything but a witch.</i>

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:29.500
Kota told me something similar before.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:34.280
<i>I used my rare vacation days to come see her,</i>

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:37.200
<i>so why is Kota all she ever talks about?!</i>

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:38.970
Can I ask you something?

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:43.230
What is it?

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.440
Nothing. Never mind.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.190
I see.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.340
<i>Honestly...</i>

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.740
<i>All she can do is be a witch,
 and she's stuck being a trainee.</i>

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.520
<i>It makes me want to help—</i>

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.570
<i>I mean, it's so irritating.</i>

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.510
This feels nice.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.100
The ocean is nice.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.840
It's fun to play with everyone here.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.000
Everyone?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.180
Kota's school friends.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.860
The guys we saw in the restaurant, 
Nishino and Sugayama, are two of them.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:28.960
Really? You made friends?

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:29.920
Yes.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:30.610
Thanks to...

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.030
Kota.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:39.620
I don't think it's wise to grow 
too close to your contractor.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.620
Once your contract ends, it's goodbye.

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:48.570
<i>Maybe I went too far...</i>

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.800
<i>But it's true.</i>

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:54.290
<i>Besides, when the contract ends, the contractor...</i>

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.000
You might be right.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:01.300
I've been having too much fun since I arrived here.

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:04.960
Y-You should talk to me about that.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.930
I'll listen any time.

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:07.760
Why?

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:08.900
Because we're friends!

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.400
Got it.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:18.490
If you get it, then report to me first thing 
when you return to the spirit world.

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.000
Got it.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.330
Excuse me!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.740
We'd like some ice candy.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:25.050
Got it.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:30.210
<i>Did she just respond to them in exactly 
the same tone as she did to me?</i>

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.880
<b>Ice Candy</b>

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:34.470
Thank you for your business.

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.030
It looks so good!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:37.110
Thank you!

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:40.970
<i>Jeez... I can't tell if she really gets it or not...</i>

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.890
Mine's good, too.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.180
Hey, Rurumo.

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:49.560
What's the first thing you plan to do
when you become a witch again?

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.920
Nothing in particular.

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:54.730
Nothing?

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.740
No, there is one thing.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.030
I'll probably...

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.780
come to thank him for helping me 
complete my training.

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:18.760
Since I heard Ruru-chan's friend 
was coming from America to visit,

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.130
I wasn't sure what to make...

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.300
Thank you so much!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.750
They all taste great.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.970
They're all Mama-san's best dishes.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:31.240
Thank you.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.320
<i>Stupid.</i>

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.990
<i>Don't you know?</i>

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.720
<i>When your training ends,</i>

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.710
<i>your contractor dies...</i>

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.480
<i>Why do you</i>

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:58.950
<i>always wish for things you can't have?</i>

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:06.910
Take care!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.640
Come back soon!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:11.330
Thanks for letting me stay with you!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.580
What a cute girl.

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:26.010
Some weirdo, ain't she?

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:28.340
Doesn't it just mean that's how close they are?

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:43.680
This is far enough.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:45.680
Listen...

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:50.640
Do you intend to continue your training 
and become a witch, no matter what?

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.940
Of course.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.350
That's why I'm training.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.540
Why would you ask such an obvious question?

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:01.980
I see.

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.010
Do your best.

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:12.260
I'll be waiting for you.

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:15.730
Wh-Where did this come from?

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:20.550
If anything happens, come talk to me.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:24.010
Okay... Got it.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.220
You're not going to?

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:27.720
That's not...

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:31.600
You know...

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:34.540
There's nothing I can do for you.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.090
But I'm rooting for you!

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:22.000
My secret?

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:25.950
Maybe that I scored a zero 
on my test the other day...

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:26.900
Mama-san!

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:28.490
Don't do that!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:31.130
The next episode is 
"A Secret I Can't Tell Anyone."

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:34.930
<b>Next Episode: A Secret I Can't Tell Anyone</b>

00:23:31.860 --> 00:23:34.260
Do I have to tell you?

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Welcome
to Rammy's.
Have a seat.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Illustration: Watanabe Wataru</b>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Don't miss
 the next episode, 
'cause if you do...!!</b>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Hey, 
are you 
listening?!</b>
